#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:5 3ca6023efea14b04bda2bd7e3354184c
msgid "Return to Launch"
msgstr "返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:7 159da1403c2c45daad7704c054d6caad
msgid ""
"Returning to Launch (either HOME or a Rally point) can be executed by "
"either switching to RTL mode or QRTL mode. In each case a key concept is "
"the return point. This is defined as the closest rally point, or if a "
"rally point is not defined, then the HOME location. See the :ref:`Rally "
"Points <common-rally-points>` page for more information on rally points."
msgstr ""
"返回起飞点（Home 或集结点）可以通过切换到 RTL 模式或 QRTL "
"模式来执行。在每种情况下，关键概念是返回点，定义为最近的集结点，若未定义集结点则为 Home 位置。有关集结点的更多信息，请参见 "
":ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:12 bffa1d9895d142d3b76bc795c795ffd3
msgid ""
"RTL mode has four different options for its behavior but basically uses "
"fixed wing flight for at least the majority of the return. Behavior also "
"depends on how close to the return point the vehicle is when entered and "
"from what mode, fixed wing or VTOL/QAssist. RTL mode behavior is "
"determined by the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter and explained "
"in the sections below."
msgstr ""
"RTL 模式有四种不同的行为选项，但基本上至少在大部分返回过程中使用固定翼飞行。其行为还取决于进入时飞机与返回点的距离以及从何种模式（固定翼或 "
"VTOL/QAssist）进入。RTL 模式行为由 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数决定，并在以下各节中说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:14 8908b21a22084eb68a1feba703e69d22
msgid ""
"QRTL mode, by default, will return either in fixed wing mode and land in "
"VTOL mode the same way as the RTL mode selected by "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3, or by using "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit (16), as a pure VTOL return and land."
msgstr ""
"QRTL 模式在默认情况下，将以固定翼模式返回并以 VTOL 模式降落，方式与 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3"
" 选择的 RTL 模式相同；或者通过设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位（16），以纯 VTOL 方式返回并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:16 a4efa2e19a254b7db007b94769bf2b7d
msgid ""
"RC failsafe when in a VTOL mode will only result in either a switch to "
"QLAND, RTL, or QRTL, depending on the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 5 "
"(QRTL) and bit 20 (RTL) settings (bit 20 overrides bit 5), independent of"
" what the :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>` or "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` setting is."
msgstr ""
"在 VTOL 模式下的 RC 失控保护只会导致切换到 QLAND、RTL 或 QRTL，具体取决于 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 5（QRTL）和位 20（RTL）的设置（位 20 覆盖位 5），与 "
":ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>` 或 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` "
"的设置无关。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:20 5974351eae7143f89151389108e47bd8
msgid "RTL Modes"
msgstr "RTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:22 0d6b6efcfd9c4439b3890523b818474e
msgid "Fixed Wing RTL"
msgstr "固定翼 RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:25 1ac291910ba547d1820a84235882497a
msgid ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 0"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:26 3d15135007f74a01907bf35c35eaaa4f
msgid "**RETURN FIXED WING AND LOITER**"
msgstr "**以固定翼方式返回并盘旋**"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:28 17c08d38feb242b1a2d47be56ad70506
msgid ""
"The default behaviour (:ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 0)of the RTL mode "
"is the same as for fixed wing. It will fly to the nearest rally point (or"
" HOME if no rally point is defined) and circle as a fixed wing aircraft "
"about that point. The VTOL motors will not be used unless the aircraft "
"drops below the airspeed defined in :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED "
"<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>`. The altitude the aircraft will circle at will be the "
"altitude in the rally point, or the :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` "
"altitude if a rally point is not being used."
msgstr ""
"RTL 模式的默认行为（:ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = "
"0）与固定翼相同。飞机将飞向最近的集结点（若未定义集结点则为 Home），并以固定翼方式在该点盘旋。除非飞机速度低于 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 定义的空速，否则不使用 VTOL "
"电机。飞机盘旋的高度将是集结点的高度，或者在不使用集结点时为 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:36 53e63c23313443c3919a00ab89d575ed
msgid ""
"If in a VTOL mode when RTL is selected (either by a failsafe action or "
"the pilot), the Quadplane will immediately transition to fixed wing and "
"fly back as if in normal fixed wing RTL mode."
msgstr ""
"若在 VTOL 模式下选择了 RTL（无论是由失控保护动作还是飞手选择），QuadPlane 将立即切换到固定翼，并如同正常固定翼 RTL "
"模式一样飞回。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:41 5321eea68c5343949c9c3b103a59862a
msgid "Hybrid RTL"
msgstr "混合 RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:43 1995be138153404d8705494d8ca1b662
msgid ""
"The another options for RTL in a QuadPlane are to fly as a fixed wing "
"aircraft until it is close to the return point at which time it switches "
"to VTOL QRTL mode and land vertically at the return point. To enable this"
" type of hybrid RTL behavior you need to set the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE "
"<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter to 1, 2, or 3."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 的另一种 RTL 选项是以固定翼方式飞行，直到接近返回点，然后切换到 VTOL QRTL "
"模式并垂直降落在返回点。要启用这种混合 RTL 行为，需要将 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数设置为 1、2 或"
" 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:48 914d50cc728f4bf385d4d54bc9ccd229
msgid ""
"for the code to judge when to start the transition to VTOL in order to "
"arrive at the point it should be totally VTOL, the "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` parameter is used to calculate the "
"when to start the transition. If the vehicle is overshooting, this value "
"can be lowered, and vice-versa."
msgstr ""
"代码使用 :ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` 参数来计算何时开始切换到 VTOL，以便在到达目标点时完全切换为"
" VTOL。若飞机超越了目标点，可降低此值；反之亦然。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:52 69843e7bd1fe4473baa97c05a55a2a58
msgid ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:53 d75977efe9234249a9c74f5deff3af7c
msgid "**RETURN FIXED WING, SWITCH TO QRTL, and LAND**"
msgstr "**以固定翼返回，切换至 QRTL 并降落**"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:55 38959748ed4a421893845e814badc7bd
msgid ""
"If in fixed wing mode when RTL is entered, the initial altitude that will"
" be aimed for in the fixed wing portion of the hybrid RTL is the same as "
"for a fixed wing RTL. You should set your rally point altitude and "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` parameters appropriately to ensure that"
" the aircraft travels at a safe altitude."
msgstr ""
"若在固定翼模式下进入 RTL，混合 RTL 固定翼阶段的初始目标高度与固定翼 RTL 相同。应适当设置集结点高度和 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 参数，以确保飞机在安全高度飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:60 3843fd1576bc47acac10eb6e74418044
msgid ""
"The distance from the return point at which the aircraft switches from "
"fixed wing to VTOL flight is set using the :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` "
"parameter, or if that is not set then the "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` parameter is used. The aircraft will "
"then slow down as it approaches the return point, aiming for an altitude "
"set by :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT <Q_RTL_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"飞机从固定翼切换到 VTOL 飞行的距离由 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 参数设置，若未设置则使用 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 参数。飞机随后将减速接近返回点，目标高度由 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT"
" <Q_RTL_ALT>` 设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:66 1fc39fa815a44b7fa8c4f986311fcbca
msgid "Once the return point is reached the aircraft begins to descend and land."
msgstr "到达返回点后，飞机开始下降并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:68 f3cefc18b8a448b48aa3e759a5b507a9
msgid ""
"If in a VTOL mode when RTL is selected (either by a failsafe action or "
"the pilot), the Quadplane will immediately transition to fixed wing and "
"fly back as if it had been entered while in a fixed wing mode."
msgstr "若在 VTOL 模式下选择了 RTL（无论是由失控保护动作还是飞手选择），QuadPlane 将立即切换到固定翼，并如同在固定翼模式下进入一样飞回。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:71 85eb3ab125e04e6b96306ee028cbc36f
msgid ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 2"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:72 dede9a19021b4fcfa774c9d54e68e0dc
msgid "**RETURN FIXED WING, LOITER TO ALT, SWITCH TO QRTL, LAND**"
msgstr "**以固定翼返回，盘旋至高度，切换至 QRTL，降落**"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:74 e52e617d0cbf437bac4287e032c44ca7
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` to 2 results in behavior similar to"
" above, but with the vehicle returning like normal fixed wing RTL until "
"it reaches :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>`, then loitering in "
"fixed wing mode down to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` altitude, and then "
"exiting facing the wind and executing a :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` to the "
"home position. Be sure the loiter portion is set up to clear any "
"obstacles."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 设为 2，行为与上述类似，但飞机将以正常固定翼 RTL 方式返回，直到到达 "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>`，然后在固定翼模式下盘旋下降至 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 高度，然后迎风飞出并执行 :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` 返回 Home "
"点。请确保盘旋部分的设置能够避开障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:76 2fc7310f11654ae8abf61e1d53a0ef57
msgid ""
"If RTL is triggered within the larger of :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` "
"and :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>`, and below "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, in a VTOL mode or assisted fixed wing "
"flight, the vehicle will proceed immediately toward "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` and the landing position and then land (ie "
":ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` mode)."
msgstr ""
"若在 VTOL 模式或辅助固定翼飞行中，RTL 在 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 与 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 两者较大值范围内且低于 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 时被触发，飞机将直接向 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` "
"和降落位置前进，然后降落（即 :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` 模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:78 36fb6fa4db6b4b1392aa1a4f56e585d7
msgid ""
"If in a VTOL mode or assisted fixed wing flight when RTL is selected "
"(either by a failsafe action or the pilot) beyond those radii, the "
"Quadplane will immediately transition to fixed wing and fly back as if it"
" had been entered while in a fixed wing mode."
msgstr ""
"若在 VTOL 模式或辅助固定翼飞行中，在这些半径之外选择了 RTL（无论是由失控保护动作还是飞手选择），QuadPlane "
"将立即切换到固定翼，并如同在固定翼模式下进入一样飞回。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:81 aa1ba58d3dde42c382bca8cb27c04744
msgid ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE <Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:82 a34b37e86225402bb037dce2fc95cc86
msgid ""
"**RETURN FIXED WING,APPROACH TO VTOL TRANSITION POINT, AIRBRAKE, SWITCH "
"TO QRTL, LAND**"
msgstr "**以固定翼返回，进近至 VTOL 过渡点，气动制动，切换至 QRTL，降落**"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:84 100d8fcb14f9454ba600eb22a6ea0a28
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` to 3 results in behavior similar to"
" a normal :ref:`QRTL <qrtl-mode>`. The vehicle will enter an \"APPROACH\""
" phase, and will return at :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` and at a "
"calculated distance, start a descent towards :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`."
" As it approaches the landing position, ArduPilot starts an "
"\"airbraking\" phase in non-tailistters to slow the vehicle and once "
"slowed enters full VTOL mode and proceeds to execute a VTOL landing. This"
" behavior is also used by default for the :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` mode "
"unless :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 is set to prevent the Hybrid "
"operation above."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 设为 3，行为类似于正常的 :ref:`QRTL <qrtl-"
"mode>`。飞机将进入「APPROACH」阶段，以 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` "
"返回，并在计算出的距离处开始向 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 下降。在接近降落位置时，ArduPilot "
"对非尾坐机型启动「气动制动」阶段，旋转 VTOL 电机产生额外制动力，减速后进入全 VTOL 模式并执行 VTOL 降落。除非设置了 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 16 来禁止上述混合操作，否则 :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` "
"模式也默认使用此行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:86 0f51ce614bec4721b70a0025dc57299f
msgid ""
"In effect, this enables the QRTL mode for any RTL actuation: failsafe "
"actions, mode change to QRTL, or completion of a mission (unless the last"
" mission item prevents RTL)."
msgstr "实际上，这使得任何 RTL 触发动作（失控保护动作、切换至 QRTL 模式或任务完成）都启用 QRTL 模式（除非最后一个任务项阻止了 RTL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:88 c7598ccdd0734478a4248e6caaacc58e
msgid ""
"This mode is also used by default in all mission VTOL_LANDINGs unless the"
" :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 is set to disable it."
msgstr "此模式也在所有任务 VTOL_LANDING 中默认使用，除非设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 16 来禁用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:90 becbd8bd17554730bd5b3f944fc4dd16
msgid ""
"This fixed wing \"approach\" allows VTOL landings to be used without "
"needing to setting up approach waypoints to reduce altitude and get close"
" enough to proceed in VTOL mode toward the landing point. If disabled by "
"bit 16, the vehicle will instantly transition to VTOL mode upon that "
"mission items execution, or upon mode changes to :ref:`QRTL <qrtl-mode>`,"
" and navigate to its landing point in VTOL before doing a QLAND. This "
"means that you should be very close to the landing site if the FW "
"approach mode is disabled in a mission since it will proceed in VTOL "
"flight to the land point."
msgstr ""
"这种固定翼「进近」方式使 VTOL 降落无需设置进近航点来降低高度并接近到 VTOL 模式可处理的距离。若被位 16 "
"禁用，飞机将在任务项执行或切换至 :ref:`QRTL <qrtl-mode>` 时立即切换为 VTOL 模式，并在 VTOL "
"模式下飞向降落点后执行 QLAND。这意味着若在任务中禁用了固定翼进近模式，在 VTOL 飞行模式下前往降落点时，您应当非常靠近降落地点。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:92 aa04fedc90744992accc8521ac7dad74
msgid ""
"The image below details the phases of the approach and landing with the "
"default setting of bit 16 (ie, not enabled):"
msgstr "下图详细说明了在位 16 默认设置（即未启用）下进近和降落的各个阶段："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:97 81f2bc2fe347441eb2ba376c4977644e
msgid "The phases of the approach are:"
msgstr "进近的各阶段为："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:99 974ea9a3d3e84b11b2abc573735898dd
msgid ""
"in a fixed wing mode when further than 2 times the greater of either "
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` or :ref:`WP_LOITER_RADS<WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"(MAXRAD) **plus** a calculated distance needed to descend from "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, the "
"plane will attempt to climb or descend to "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>`. If within that range, it will attempt "
"to climb/descend to a linear descent slope, meet it, and continue to "
"descend, as shown above."
msgstr ""
"在固定翼模式下，若距离超过 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 或 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RADS<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 两者较大值（MAXRAD）的 2 倍 **加上** 从 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 下降到 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` "
"所需的计算距离，飞机将尝试爬升或下降至 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>`。若在该范围内，则尝试爬升/下降至线性下降坡面并沿其继续下降，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:100 0d0eb4eb218d48e6badf1dca5c4ad711
msgid ""
"if started further than 2X \"MAXRAD\" but closer than above, at 2x MAXRAD"
" it will continue in fixed wing mode at :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"若开始时距离超过 2 倍 MAXRAD 但比上述更近，则在 2 倍 MAXRAD 处以 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` "
"继续固定翼飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:101 c7fed9c90044441d970293d58c95b472
msgid ""
"when it reaches a point that is within the VTOL stopping distance of the "
"landing point (calculated using the VTOL deceleration parameter "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` which gives the deceleration that "
"will occur as the vehicle transitions to VTOL and the vehicle's current "
"speed), it will transition to VTOL mode and send a message that it is in "
"\"VTOL Position1\" and continue moving to the land point. If the vehicle "
"is NOT a tailsitter, an \"AIRBRAKING\" phase may occur before the VTOL "
"transition, spinning up the VTOL motors to create additional braking."
msgstr ""
"当飞机到达距降落点的 VTOL 停止距离内（使用 VTOL 减速参数 :ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` "
"计算，该参数给出飞机过渡到 VTOL 时的减速度以及当前速度），将切换到 VTOL 模式并发送消息表示进入「VTOL "
"Position1」，继续向降落点移动。若飞机不是尾坐型，在 VTOL 过渡前可能会出现「气动制动」阶段，旋转 VTOL 电机产生额外制动力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:103 c347f644529248a0a00fb12fdc3ea589
msgid ""
"if the vehicle is overshooting \"VTOL Position1\", try decreasing  "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` in steps. However, this increases the"
" point before \"VTOL Position1\" that the vehicle will transition to "
"VTOL."
msgstr ""
"若飞机超越了「VTOL Position1」，尝试分步减小 "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>`。但这会增加飞机在「VTOL Position1」之前开始 VTOL "
"过渡的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:105 0b475cfe15214847ad45867330b0f0d6
msgid ""
"once the QuadPlane is within 5m of the land point and moving less than 2 "
"m/s, it will send a GCS message declaring that it is in \"VTOL Position "
"2\", and final position itself over the land point and begin its landing "
"descent, which will also be indicated by GCS messages"
msgstr ""
"一旦 QuadPlane 位于降落点 5m 范围内且速度低于 2 m/s，将向地面站发送消息表示进入「VTOL Position "
"2」，并在降落点上方最终定位，开始降落下降，同时也会通过地面站消息提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:106 b8fccd817e9a43078a13d61827237b18
msgid ""
"if the approach is entered less than 1.5X MAXRAD, it will immediately "
"move to \"VTOL Position 1\" state, whether entered from fixed wing or "
"VTOL modes, and move toward the landing site attempting to obtain "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` as it does so."
msgstr ""
"若进近在 1.5 倍 MAXRAD 以内开始，无论是从固定翼还是 VTOL 模式进入，都将立即进入「VTOL Position "
"1」状态，并在向降落点移动的过程中尝试达到 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:107 42e3b2e6bc704073864aa3aa717ef6c3
msgid ""
"if in VTOL mode at greater than 1.5X MAXRAD, the  vehicle will climb to "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, if below, then transition to fixed wing and "
"start a normal fixed wing RTL, and attempt to navigate to home, executing"
" the approach. The climb and turn toward the landing point will occur at "
"even low altitudes as determined by :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, so the "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bit 4 for \"Climb before turn in "
"RTL\" and/or :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 0 for \"Level Transitions\" "
"might be worth considering for the fixed wing initial phases."
msgstr ""
"若在 VTOL 模式下且距离超过 1.5 倍 MAXRAD，若高度低于 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，则切换至固定翼并开始正常固定翼 RTL，尝试导航至 Home，执行进近。即使在由 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 决定的低高度下，也会爬升并转向降落点，因此 "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 位 4（RTL 中先爬升再转弯）和/或 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 0（水平过渡）可能值得考虑用于固定翼初始阶段。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:109 3ca1d5fd34934d11acf1f3803ec30d95
msgid ""
"In cases where it is feared that using the approach feature may result in"
" it being initiated too close to HOME due to the 1.5X MAXRAD distance "
"being too close in VTOL modes, instead of using "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 to disable the feature entirely, the "
":ref:`Q_APPROACH_DIST<Q_APPROACH_DIST>` to increase the distance from "
"HOME that the vehicle needs to be to transition to fixed wing and execute"
" an approach,"
msgstr ""
"在担心进近功能可能因 1.5 倍 MAXRAD 距离在 VTOL 模式下过近而被过早触发时，可以不使用 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 16 完全禁用该功能，而是使用 "
":ref:`Q_APPROACH_DIST<Q_APPROACH_DIST>` 来增加飞机从 Home 点切换至固定翼并执行进近所需的最小距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:112 9ade28739a954636a6b2ad6bbe0b051d
msgid "QRTL Mode"
msgstr "QRTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:114 043b25ce8eeb4fb8a15f5f1e84de21c8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, switching to :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` mode will act exactly as "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3, above. However, if you prefer to do "
"return to launch as a pure VTOL aircraft (like a multirotor would do) "
"then you can use the :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` flight mode, but with "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 set in order to disable QRTL's default"
" behavior (which is like the hybrid RTL described above with "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3). The vehicle will transition to VTOL "
"flight, if not already in VTOL, and then fly at the "
":ref:`Q_WP_SPD<Q_WP_SPD>` speed towards the return point, at an altitude "
"of :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT <Q_RTL_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，切换至 :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` 模式的行为与 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3"
" 完全相同（见上文）。但若希望以纯 VTOL 方式（类似多旋翼）返回起飞点，可以使用 :ref:`QRTL<qrtl-mode>` "
"飞行模式，并设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 16 来禁用 QRTL 的默认行为（即上述 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3 的混合 RTL 行为）。飞机将切换至 VTOL 飞行（若尚未处于 VTOL "
"模式），然后以 :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED <Q_WP_SPEED>` 速度飞向返回点，高度为 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT "
"<Q_RTL_ALT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:118 c20f483df9534788b687a1b10f229488
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the return point is reached the aircraft will start a vertical "
"descent towards the ground for landing. The initial descent rate is set "
"by :ref:`Q_WP_SPD_DN<Q_WP_SPD_DN>`. Once the aircraft reaches an altitude"
" of :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT <Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` the descent rate will "
"change to :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD <Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` for the final "
"landing phase."
msgstr ""
"到达返回点后，飞机将开始垂直下降至地面降落。初始下降速率由 :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_DN <Q_WP_SPEED_DN>` "
"设定。当飞机到达 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT <Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 高度时，下降速率将切换为 "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD <Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` 用于最终降落阶段。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane_rtl.rst:125 0d1980d8d562464796970feb623696b5
msgid ""
"In the final landing phase the aircraft will detect landing by looking "
"for when the VTOL motor throttle drops below a minimum threshold for 5 "
"seconds. When that happens the aircraft will disarm and the VTOL motors "
"will stop."
msgstr "在最终降落阶段，飞机通过检测 VTOL 电机油门是否连续 5 秒低于最小阈值来判断是否已着陆。当检测到着陆时，飞机将上锁，VTOL 电机停止。"

